{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1549591-ahadi-in-all-their-long-memory-nothing-like-this-has-ever-worked-wait-what","id":1549591,"title":"Ahadi - \"in all their long memory, nothing like this has ever worked.\" Wait, what?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-03-27T03:29:18-07:00","id":1549591,"title":"Ahadi - \"in all their long memory, nothing like this has ever worked.\" Wait, what?","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Mokol\u00e9 outside the Ahadi consider the entire affair to be either well outside of the task Gaia gave them, or a mad pipe dream that will never work \u2014 in all their long memory, nothing like this has ever worked. </div> </div> </div>I find this quote really interesting, but my immediate response is &quot;... the Beast Courts are a pan-Fera alliance, aren't they? Isn't that an ancient and successful example of exactly this?&quot;<br /> <br /> Have I completely misunderstood what the Beast Courts are? Or is the Ahadi seen to be new and unique because it has mixed packs bound by a totem spirit, and Fera wading in to help eachother with their respective roles since their numbers are so depleted?<br /> <br /> So yeah, basically, what is this quote saying? Mnesis includes nothing like the Ahadi, but in which sense, because we can very clearly see an existing and giant organization which has similar cooperation (perhaps not as deep?) going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T14:10:05-07:00","id":1549600,"title":"","content":"If the word Mokole is referring just to the Stream perhaps the Zhong Lungs project is outside the frame of reference?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T14:16:32-07:00","id":1549601,"title":"","content":"Perhaps, but &quot;nothing like this has ever worked in history... in Africa...&quot; is a very different idea to what it feels like the sentence is trying to say.<br /> <br /> With any other Breed I could imagine ignorance being an explanation, but the Mokole are arguably by default the least ignorant Breed. Different streams have access to different Mnesis, but access to the fact that there are Asian Mokole who are part of a pan-Fera alliance feels like it would be pretty common. More to the point, the Ahadi include a few Kitsune and other Asian Fera, so it feels like at this point any African Fera who aren't very isolated or hostile to outside information (and, to be fair, a lot of Fera across the whole World of Darkness fit that description!) would know at least vaguely that the Beast Courts exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T14:40:36-07:00","id":1549603,"title":"","content":"Given how far back the Mnesis stretches, it\u2019s perfectly possible (and slightly scary) to imagine that the Mokole mean that both the Beast Courts and the Ahadi are enjoying the honeymoon period of an experiment that has been attempted before and ALWAYS ended in tears \u2026","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T14:42:35-07:00","id":1549604,"title":"","content":"Fair. Perhaps referring to the &quot; looser&quot; structure of the Ahadi compared to the more codified BC?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T15:01:48-07:00","id":1549608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Atticus Cleanclaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1549591-ahadi-in-all-their-long-memory-nothing-like-this-has-ever-worked-wait-what?p=1549603#post1549603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how far back the Mnesis stretches, it\u2019s perfectly possible (and slightly scary) to imagine that the Mokole mean that both the Beast Courts and the Ahadi are enjoying the honeymoon period of an experiment that has been attempted before and ALWAYS ended in tears \u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh now THAT is a great answer. I really like that.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Beast Courts still exist!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The first time the Hungry Dead turned their attention to the Hengeyokai, they turned on one another and engaged in wanton slaughter. Similar Fera Empires have existed, believe me, and many fell around the age the Beast Courts are now.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T15:02:57-07:00","id":1549609,"title":"","content":"I mean we know from some, brief, mentions that The Americas and Oceania had cooperation and coordination between Fera in the past as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-28T13:19:12-07:00","id":1549619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1549591-ahadi-in-all-their-long-memory-nothing-like-this-has-ever-worked-wait-what?p=1549608#post1549608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh now THAT is a great answer. I really like that.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Beast Courts still exist!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The first time the Hungry Dead turned their attention to the Hengeyokai, they turned on one another and engaged in wanton slaughter. Similar Fera Empires have existed, believe me, and many fell around the age the Beast Courts are now.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank You most kindly for the complement - I tend to assume that if one can remember the length of recorded history and then some, you tend to take the skeptical view of just about <i>everything</i>.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-04T17:18:45-07:00","id":1549833,"title":"","content":"Even then, I think that saying it &quot;<i>never works</i>&quot; is more than a bit too much. Just because it worked for a limited time doesn't mean it didn't worked, and that we still feel the benefits.<br /> <br /> And Africa already had that and more, in Egypt. Given how far in the past Egyptian history goes, even if it ended a thousand years before Rome, the Egyptian coalition could have lasted more than 2 thousand years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-05T19:21:25-07:00","id":1549857,"title":"","content":"The War of Shame was one hiccup compared to the War of Rage. And the Beast Courts have still managed to hold together for something like five millennia afterwards, so unless you're insisting on tens of thousands, hundreds of thousands, or millions of years of peace (during which time some of the kin of a changer could alter so drastically as to render them extinct without the aid of the Mokole) as the standard, the track record is probably not that bad for the Beast Courts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-06T01:38:02-07:00","id":1549864,"title":"","content":"Yeah I think the most charitable and lore-compatible read is that they're saying &quot;a ragtag alliance of Fera built in an emergency, with them all getting involved in eachother's business and trying to help and train and even pack-bond with eachother, has never worked before&quot;. I actually think it's pretty fitting if the Ahadi find out pretty early on, via Mnesis, that a hopeful alliance like this has been forged before, perhaps 10s of times, and it's always failed.<br /> <br /> I think it's very fitting to the themes of WTA if such an alliance goes &quot;alright, then this time we'll succeed - if you're willing to help us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}